<title>USA: Polydex holders approve reverse split.</title>
<headline>Polydex holders approve reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polydex Pharmaceuticals Ltd said Thursday its shareholders approved a one-for-ten reverse split of the company's shares.</p>
<p>The company said management had recommended the reduction in shares outstanding to solidify the company's Nasdaq listing.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
